As our normal map sort the data in asscending order, wo we will use the timer variable initially it will be INT_MAX so, the upcoming tweets will be at starting.

When fetching the tweets we simply check is the tweet id belongs to the userId or any of its friend if yes add it to answer and do, it till we fetch the top 10 recent tweets by the user or its friend
# Code
