# Intuition
<!-- Describe your first thoughts on how to solve this problem. -->
simple push all the co-ordinates of the first and second island in two vectors by using dfs and then just calculate the distance between each point to every other point in both the vectors and since n is very small we will not get tle and this solution is accepted.
# Approach
<!-- Describe your approach to solving the problem. -->
**1.Push all the co-ordinates of the first and second island in two vectors
2.then calculate the distance between each point to every point 
3.take the minimum distance 
4.return the minimum distance**
# Complexity
