# Intuition
We need to find all prime numbers between range(left, right) using minimum time complexity. 

# Approach
For finding prime number between left and right range we use sieve algorithm. It takes O(nlog(logn)) time. Then, we find prime number pairs having minimum difference and return them.

# Complexity
- Time complexity:
O(nlog(logn))

- Space complexity:
