# Intuition
<!-- Describe your first thoughts on how to solve this problem. -->
Whenever the shopowner is not grumpy, the customers are added irrespective of when the minutes are, so add the customers to ans whenever he is not grumpy. Now change customers to 0 whenever the shop owner is not grumpy. 
Now the question is changed to the maximum sum of subarray with window size minutes. (standard sliding window problem)

# Approach
<!-- Describe your approach to solving the problem. -->

# Complexity
- Time complexity: O(N)
<!-- Add your time complexity here, e.g. $$O(n)$$ -->

- Space complexity: O(1)
<!-- Add your space complexity here, e.g. $$O(n)$$ -->

