# Approach
We can use vector of length 26 to track the occurences of character. 
If the size of both string is different then they can't be anagram of each other, so we are checking this first.We loop through each character in both strings and increment the frequency of the corresponding letter in s and decrement the frequency of the corresponding letter in t.
Then we loop through freq array if all the elements are 0, if all the elements are 0 this means the two strings are anagram and if not then these things are not anagram of each othe.
