# Intuition
  To maximise sum, ***try to group larger number together***-the only way   to do so is by sorting.
# Approach
 1. Sort the given vector.

 2. Sum first number i.e min from a pair - to do so *increment counter by 2*, by doing so you will always lend into smallest number of a pair 
# Complexity
- Time complexity: O(NlogN)

- Space complexity: O(1)


# Code
```
class Solution {
public:
    int arrayPairSum(vector<int>& nums) {
        sort(nums.begin(),nums.end());
        int sum=0;
        for(int i=0;i<nums.size();i+=2)
            sum+=nums[i];
        return sum;
    }
};
