# Intuition
<!-- Describe your first thoughts on how to solve this problem. -->
C++ solution using binary search to find  the least upper bound i_max for the column vector grid[i][0] first.

Then using a for-loop to sum up the values for m-binarS(grid[i]) where i<i_max

Finally,  add the number (n-i_max)*m to the desired variable sum.

# Approach
