The idea is must guarantee:
- Number of L, R are the same and keep ordering. 
- Number of X on the left of L from `end` always less than or equal the corresponding L from `start`
- Number of X on the right of R from `end` always more than or equal the corresponding R from `start`

We can terminate the process early once got the first violation, no need to loop through the end of `start`.

