> # Approach
Let's use some data structutes to solve this problem,By adding even indexed numbers into MinHeap we can sort the data in ascending order,By adding odd indexed numbers into Maxheap we can sort the data in descending order. 
<!-- Describe your approach to solving the problem. -->

> # Complexity
- Time complexity: O(n log(n))
