# Intuition
at any particular cell grid(i,j) we need the minm of all cells of f(i+1,{0 to j-1}) and all minm of cells of f(i+1,{j+1 to n-1})


# I have shared both recursive/memo code and alternate tabulation code on same code space . Have a look into the soln and do let me know if any confusion . Please do upvote if you find the soln helpful 🚀

